            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 131115,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il codice per fare in modo che la funzione funzioni come previsto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"typescript.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name + \" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Miriam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Miriam!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>name</code>, seguito da <code>:</code> e poi <code>string</code>, <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 131136,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cos'è un enum in TypeScript?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un enum è un modo per definire un insieme di costanti denominate</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un enum è un modo per definire una classe</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un enum è un modo per definire un'interfaccia</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un enum è un modo per definire un insieme di costanti denominate.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 131117,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi il tipo restituito corretto alla funzione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"typescript.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  greet(): \" /><text value=\"void\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello. I'm &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Pia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person.greet();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"string\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"boolean\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello. I'm Pia!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>void</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 131137,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che tipo ha il valore restituito da questa funzione?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" myFunction: \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"input: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">numero</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">string</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">boolean</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">qualsiasi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere numero.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 131127,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi i tipi corretti per completare la funzione <code>logMessage</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"logMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"): \" /><text value=\"void\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"logMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"void\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>string</code>, seguito da <code>void</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
